      "content": "The GKE On-Prem API provides programmatic access to manage the lifecycle of on-premises Kubernetes clusters running on VMware or bare metal infrastructure as part of Google Distributed Cloud. It enables creating, updating, deleting, and monitoring clusters, managing node pools, and handling enrollment and upgrades.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Google Cloud Support",
